+\subsection*{Governing-law structures}
+
+\begin{definition}[Equation of state of the paramagnet]
+\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_3_B_1:SatisfiesEOS}
+\lean{IPhO2026.Problem3.B1.SatisfiesEOS}
