+\begin{definition}[Heat-capacity law for the internal energy]
+\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_3_B_1:HasHeatCapacityLaw}
+\lean{IPhO2026.Problem3.B1.HasHeatCapacityLaw}
