+\begin{definition}[First law with magnetic work, isothermal form]
+\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_3_B_1:ObeysFirstLawMagnetic}
+\lean{IPhO2026.Problem3.B1.ObeysFirstLawMagnetic}
